$('albumPickerNew').onclick=()=>{$('albumPicker').close();openAlbumEditor();};$('albumPickerSave').onclick=()=>{if(updateCard(albumPickId,{albumIds:[...$('albumPickerChecks').querySelectorAll('input:checked')].map(x=>x.value)},'Alben geändert')){$('albumPicker').close();albumPickId=null;if($('cardDialog').open)showDetail();}};
